{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>How long shall this be a snare to us.</b> By way of the plain sense (peshat): because of Moshe they said thus, as it is written (Exodus 32:1): ״כי זה משה האיש״ — for through him the plagues came upon them, and through them they are ensnared. <br><b>And it is possible</b> also to interpret ״עד מתי יהיה זה״ as an allusion to what is written (Exodus 15:2): ״זה אלי ואנוהו״, (ibid. 13): ״שבעבור זה עשה ה׳ לי״ — and the verse reveals to us through this expression their evil intent, for they denied the root principle."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:57:26.710079586Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}